<link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/infographic-property-ads-anatomy.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo:wght@600;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap">
<div class="n3l-property-ads">
<figure class="fig">

  <header class="mast">
    <span class="eyebrow brand-eyebrow">NEXT3LABS &mdash; property advertising</span>
    <h1>One ad button, <span class="hi">three jobs</span></h1>
    <p class="sub">The words. The surfaces. The claims. Only two are assembly.</p>
    <div class="mast-rule"></div>
  </header>

  <div class="cols-head">
    <span class="eyebrow">The anatomy of an ad generator</span>
    <span class="legend"><i class="dot dot--go" aria-hidden="true"></i> hand over
      &nbsp;<i class="dot dot--mid" aria-hidden="true"></i> behind the agent
      &nbsp;<i class="dot dot--stop" aria-hidden="true"></i> never auto</span>
  </div>

  <ol class="cols">

    <li class="col col--go">
      <div class="col-head">
        <span class="col-num num" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
        <h2>The words</h2>
        <span class="tag tag--go">Hand over</span>
      </div>
      <ul class="items">
        <li class="item">Listing title + description</li>
        <li class="item">Ad variants</li>
        <li class="item">Carousel captions</li>
        <li class="item">WhatsApp broadcast</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="note">The agent edits every line before it goes out.</p>
    </li>

    <li class="col col--mid2">
      <div class="col-head">
        <span class="col-num num" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
        <h2>The surfaces</h2>
        <span class="tag tag--go">Hand over</span>
      </div>
      <ul class="items">
        <li class="item">Listing crop</li>
        <li class="item">4:5 carousel</li>
        <li class="item">Story</li>
        <li class="item">Thumbnail</li>
        <li class="item">WhatsApp card</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="note">One photo shoot, every format &mdash; mechanical work with a correct answer.</p>
    </li>

    <li class="col col--stop">
      <div class="col-head">
        <span class="col-num num" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
        <h2>The claims</h2>
        <span class="tag tag--mid">Behind the agent</span>
        <span class="tag tag--stop">Never auto</span>
      </div>
      <ul class="items">
        <li class="item">Psf and below-valuation claims</li>
        <li class="item">Rental yield / ROI hints</li>
        <li class="item">Market-direction claims</li>
        <li class="item">Urgency &mdash; last unit, closing soon</li>
        <li class="item item--hard">The agent's face, voice, testimonials</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="note">Every number a person verifies; scarcity only if true; nothing about the agent is generated.</p>
    </li>

  </ol>

  <section class="pilot">
    <span class="eyebrow pilot-label">The 30-minute pilot</span>
    <ul class="metrics">
      <li class="metric">Hours per exclusive</li>
      <li class="metric">Edits per surface</li>
      <li class="metric">Invented claims caught</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="pilot-note">Run it on the next real exclusive, not a demo.</p>
  </section>

  <figcaption class="foot">
    <span class="verdict">assembly is free now</span>
    <span class="sep" aria-hidden="true">&middot;</span>
    <span class="verdict">judgement is not</span>
    <span class="sep" aria-hidden="true">&middot;</span>
    <span class="verdict twist">the pilot settles it</span>
  </figcaption>

</figure>
</div>
